+# Safety Certification & Organizational Signoff Plan
+
+Purpose
+- Provide a practical checklist and mapping from Aegis artifacts to certification evidence required for ISO/functional safety or other standards.
+
+Sections
+1. Identification of Safety-Relevant Functions
+   - Controllers, emergency stop, safety interlocks, HIL behaviors, and motion planners.
+2. Hazard Analysis & Risk Assessment (HARA)
+   - Define severity and SOTIF/ASIL levels per function.
+3. Requirements Traceability
+   - Map requirements to tests, code, and evidence manifests (use ops/sdk/evidence_sdk.record_manifest to link).
+4. HIL Test Coverage
+   - Mandatory HIL test campaigns: jitter, safe-stop, sensor-failure, network-partition, power-failure.
+5. Formal Verification
+   - Apply formal-method checks to high-risk controllers and promotion policies (ops/formal/*).
+6. Third-Party Audit
+   - Package auditor bundle (ops/ci/prepare_auditor_bundle.sh) containing logs, code rev, Rekor/cosign entries, HIL artifacts.
+
+Operator responsibilities
+- Operate HIL lab, execute campaigns, collect signed evidence bundles, and coordinate with certifying body.
